<title>HONG KONG: DC Finance says in talks with GITIC.</title>
<headline>DC Finance says in talks with GITIC.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Directors of DC Finance (Holdings) Ltd said on Wednesday the company may issue new shares to Guangdong International Trust and Investment Corp H.K. (Holdings) Ltd.</p>
<p>&quot;The company is in discussions with Guangdong International Trust and Investment Corp (GITIC) H.K. Ltd regarding various proposals which include a possible issue of new shares by the company,&quot; DC Finance said in a statement issued through the stock exchange.</p>
<p>No agreement has been reached and no binding agreement has been entered into, it said.</p>
<p>DC Finance ended Wednesday morning's session HK$0.05 higher at HK$5.25.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6933</p>
</text>
